                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.20/466: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Liberia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Walton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-06-13T18:00:00-04:00">June 13, 1939—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>26. Your 42, June 9, 5 p.m. The Department has no objection to your showing
                    President Barclay in strict confidence a copy of the telegram referred to, but
                    believes it inadvisable to leave him a paraphrase.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
